            <div xml:id="d594-a1-a20">

                <pb facs="0575" n="501" xml:id="pg501"/>

                <head>No. 21.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Telegram.–<date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1865-02-17">February 17, 1865</date>.]</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">James Harvey, American Minister, Lisbon:</hi></p>
                <p>Repairs on Stonewall limited; since finished is reported in very bad condition;
                    cannot go to sea; leaks badly; her commander starts for Paris; ber builder
                    expected from Bordeaux. Consul says will have to be abandoned. Niagara vigilant.
                    Where is Sacramento?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>PERRY.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
